ication_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local structural construction checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-additive-linear\">df-additive-linear</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a70f24e0154f1736\" href=\"?note=a70f24e0154f1736\" title=\"72-df-linear-logic\">72-df-linear-logic</a> 的公式、多重集和规则集合，所有规则实例均保留该定义的旁条件。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{supp}(\\Gamma)=\\{A:\\Gamma(A)&gt;0\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{supp}(\\Gamma)=\\{A:\\Gamma(A)&gt;0\\}\\)</span>；片段中的其余规则也只取全部判断属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_k\">\\(U_k\\)</span> 的实例（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=M\">\\(k=M\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>，按下式）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nF^{A}_0&amp;:=\\{p^+,p^-:p\\in P\\}\\cup\\{\\mathbf0,\\top\\},\\\\\nF^{A}_{n+1}&amp;:=F^{A}_n\\cup\\{A\\circ B:A,B\\in F^{A}_n,\\circ\\in\\{\\oplus,\\mathbin{\\&amp;}\\}\\},\\quad\\mathcal F_A:=\\bigcup_nF^{A}_n,\\\\\nU_A&amp;:=\\{\\vdash\\Gamma\\in U_{LL}:\\operatorname{supp}(\\Gamma)\\subseteq\\mathcal F_A\\},\\\\\nR_{id,A}&amp;:=R_{id}\\cap(U_A^{&lt;\\omega}\\times U_A),\\quad R_{cut,A}:=R_{cut}\\cap(U_A^{&lt;\\omega}\\times U_A).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nF^{A}_0&amp;:=\\{p^+,p^-:p\\in P\\}\\cup\\{\\mathbf0,\\top\\},\\\\\nF^{A}_{n+1}&amp;:=F^{A}_n\\cup\\{A\\circ B:A,B\\in F^{A}_n,\\circ\\in\\{\\oplus,\\mathbin{\\&amp;}\\}\\},\\quad\\mathcal F_A:=\\bigcup_nF^{A}_n,\\\\\nU_A&amp;:=\\{\\vdash\\Gamma\\in U_{LL}:\\operatorname{supp}(\\Gamma)\\subseteq\\mathcal F_A\\},\\\\\nR_{id,A}&amp;:=R_{id}\\cap(U_A^{&lt;\\omega}\\times U_A),\\quad R_{cut,A}:=R_{cut}\\cap(U_A^{&lt;\\omega}\\times U_A).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{ALL}:=\\langle\\mathcal F_A,\\operatorname{Cl}_{U_A}(R_{id,A}\\cup R_\\oplus\\cup R_{\\&amp;}\\cup R_\\top\\cup R_{cut,A})\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{ALL}:=\\langle\\mathcal F_A,\\operatorname{Cl}_{U_A}(R_{id,A}\\cup R_\\oplus\\cup R_{\\&amp;}\\cup R_\\top\\cup R_{cut,A})\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>规则是有前提序列与结论的有序对集合，非一个没有定义的可导性谓词。片段语法由有限构造迭代给出；指数节点指完整命题LL中!/?规则层，不把一般结构规则加回非指数公式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-additive-linear","text":"df-additive-linear","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-linear-logic","status":"resolved","id":"a70f24e0154f1736","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-linear-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-linear-logic","status":"resolved","id":"a70f24e0154f1736","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-linear-logic]] 的公式、多重集和规则集合，所有规则实例均保留该定义的旁条件。 $\\operatorname{supp}(\\Gamma)=\\{A:\\Gamma(A)>0\\}$；片段中的其余规则也只取全部判断属于 $U_k$ 的实例（$k=M$ 或 $A$，按下式）。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{supp}(\\Gamma)=\\{A:\\Gamma(A)>0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"U_k","display":false},{"tex":"k=M","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nF^{A}_0&:=\\{p^+,p^-:p\\in P\\}\\cup\\{\\mathbf0,\\top\\},\\\\\nF^{A}_{n+1}&:=F^{A}_n\\cup\\{A\\circ B:A,B\\in F^{A}_n,\\circ\\in\\{\\oplus,\\mathbin{\\&}\\}\\},\\quad\\mathcal F_A:=\\bigcup_nF^{A}_n,\\\\\nU_A&:=\\{\\vdash\\Gamma\\in U_{LL}:\\operatorname{supp}(\\Gamma)\\subseteq\\mathcal F_A\\},\\\\\nR_{id,A}&:=R_{id}\\cap(U_A^{<\\omega}\\times U_A),\\quad R_{cut,A}:=R_{cut}\\cap(U_A^{<\\omega}\\times U_A).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{ALL}:=\\langle\\mathcal F_A,\\operatorname{Cl}_{U_A}(R_{id,A}\\cup R_\\oplus\\cup R_{\\&}\\cup R_\\top\\cup R_{cut,A})\\rangle.","display":true}],"bytes":1813,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-302","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-additive-linear|df-additive-linear — Additive Linear Logic]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-302","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-additive-linear|df-additive-linear — Additive Linear Logic]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-additive-linear|72-df-additive-linear]]"}],"outgoing":["a70f24e0154f1736"]}